      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. the part about compliance costs really hits home for what i'm trying to argue. i was thinking, do you think people who argue for more regulation are just prioritizing bureaucracy over actual progress? like, is there a real economic case for all that red tape, or is it mostly just about control at this point? i want to make i the counter-argument part",
